# The two docs generated from the tree and committed. Merging them line by line
# produces a file the generator would never emit, cleanly and with no signal —
# see scripts/merge-generated-doc.js for what that looks like and why. The
# driver is registered per clone by scripts/setup-git-hooks.js (npm postinstall);
# without it git falls back to a normal merge, so this is a safety net rather
# than a guarantee, and CI's --check steps stay the real gate.
docs/module-map.md merge=generated-doc
CLAUDE.md merge=generated-doc
